      "title": "Inconsistent RECIST 1.1 table: CR with non-CR/non-PD non-target lesions is listed as PR, but should be PR only if non-target is non-CR/non-PD; however, the table also lists CR with non-CR/non-PD as PR, which is correct per RECIST, but the row 'CR, Not evaluated' is listed as PR, which is incorrect (should be PR only if no PD, but not evaluated is not allowed for CR).",
      "page": 110,
      "quote": "CR   Not evaluated   No   PR",
      "severity": "major"
    },
    {
      "title": "Inconsistent RECIST 1.1 table: PD row with 'Any' non-target and 'Yes or No' new lesions is listed as PD, but the footnote says 'no prior SD, PR, or CR' which is contradictory because PD can occur after prior SD/PR/CR.",
      "page": 110,
      "quote": "PD   Any   Yes or No   PD   no prior SD, PR, or CR",
      "severity": "major"
    },
    {
      "title": "Inconsistent RECIST 1.1 table: The row 'Any   Any   Yes   PD' is redundant and contradicts the previous row that already includes 'Yes' for new lesions.",
